{"componentChunkName":"component---src-pages-new-projects-js","path":"new-projects/sky-vista-peace-homes-group-jvc-jumeirah-village-circle","result":{"serverData":{"data":{"status":true,"message":"Property details fetch successfully","data":{"id":535,"crm_id":"1155","search_type":"sales","department":"new_developments","status":"pending","title":"Sky Vista","slug":"sky-vista-peace-homes-group-jvc-jumeirah-village-circle","display_address":"Jumeirah Village Circle (JVC)","building_type":["apartment"],"completion_year":"2026","developer":"Peace Homes Group","price":3324316,"display_price":"3.324M","lattitude":25.0547869,"longitude":55.2085493,"min_bedrooms":2,"max_bedrooms":3,"display_bedrooms":null,"about":"<p>Sky Vista is a magnificent 17-storey residential building that embodies sophistication in every detail. From the welcoming panoramic lobby to the elegant furnished houses, here you will plunge into the atmosphere of luxury and comfort.</p><p>The exterior of Sky Vista impresses with its modern architecture and attractive design. The majestic facade perfectly fits into the urban landscape of Jumeirah Village Circle, creating an impressive view from afar and impressing inside.</p><p>Each residence in Sky Vista offers residents coziness and comfort, providing excellent living conditions. The affordable <strong>2 and 3 bedroom apartments </strong>are furnished to the highest standards of quality and style.</p><p>The interiors of Sky Vista inspire elegance and sophistication. Each room is decorated taking into account the latest trends in interior design, and furniture and decoration create an atmosphere of wealth and comfort.</p><p>Among the main amenities of Sky Vista you will find an infinity pool, an open-air cinema, private offices, as well as sports fields and recreation areas. All this makes life in Sky Vista surprisingly comfortable and diverse.</p><p>Located in the heart of Jumeirah Village Circle, Sky Vista offers convenient access to everything Dubai has to offer. From restaurants and shops to parks and attractions, everything is in the immediate vicinity of your new home.</p><p>Welcome to Sky Vista, an oasis of luxury and comfort in the heart of Dubai.</p>","tile_image":null,"banner_image":null,"media_images":null,"images":[{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/off-plan/1155/images/2024/04/03/0kvAhpFzrleWwWt9JUpbSLXvhEh5Nv1xsdoe15gI.png","srcUrl":"https://cdn.geniemap.net/2024/04/03/0kvAhpFzrleWwWt9JUpbSLXvhEh5Nv1xsdoe15gI.png","__ggfxIndex":0},{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/off-plan/1155/images/2024/04/01/9f9SOwCFhYX1iXxSGqhlRjTLGDIPIdDVoVTYCI1q.png","srcUrl":"https://cdn.geniemap.net/2024/04/01/9f9SOwCFhYX1iXxSGqhlRjTLGDIPIdDVoVTYCI1q.png","__ggfxIndex":1},{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/off-plan/1155/images/2024/04/01/DX9vEOECpQykUtjyuobjNSpPNqOcy7RSLgvplBhe.png","srcUrl":"https://cdn.geniemap.net/2024/04/01/DX9vEOECpQykUtjyuobjNSpPNqOcy7RSLgvplBhe.png","__ggfxIndex":2}],"characteristics_module":null,"location_tile":null,"brochure":{"id":1909,"url":"","file":null,"item":[],"image":null},"video_module":{"id":1164,"thumbnail":null,"video_url":null},"floor_plans":[{"id":2014,"url":null,"area":null,"size":null,"media":null,"title":"1 Bedroom Apartment","kitchen":null,"parking":null,"flooring":null,"ceiling_height":null,"starting_price":null},{"id":2015,"url":null,"area":null,"size":null,"media":null,"title":"2 Bedroom Apartment","kitchen":null,"parking":null,"flooring":null,"ceiling_height":null,"starting_price":null}],"payment_plan_text":"50/50 ","payment_plans":[{"id":5871,"title":"20%","description":"Down payment"},{"id":5872,"title":"30%","description":"During construction"},{"id":5873,"title":"50%","description":"On handover"}],"community":"Jumeirah Village Circle (JVC)","publish":1,"currency":"","amenities":[{"id":9656,"url":null,"text":"Shared Pool","type":null,"image":null},{"id":9657,"url":null,"text":"Shared SPA